<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32617" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπέσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπερί-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cook thoroughly</i>: hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of animals,
			<i>digest</i> or <i>concoct</i> food <i>thoroughly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of plants,
				<i>ripen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν καρπόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					2.2.4
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, of nourishment, <i>to be assimilated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Col.</u>
				799a11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of eggs,
				<i>hatch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				562b18
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>ripen, bring to a head,</i> of an abscess, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.142
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
